  "text_to_speech": "It's off center again! Something is coming from below! Hurry up! Captain! Captain Hugues! Flee! It's going to explode! Separate unit number 2! Unit Two, rip it out! You gotta be kidding me... Message from the Invisible Knights: Lieutenant Christo to Vortex 2: \"Because of the Federations resistance, we are in a stalemate. Further progress has been hindered.\" Over. Our morale is still high. Vortex 2 commander Erik, acknowledging. The Federation's main force is not in the N field? Somethings coming out? What's that kind of Mobile Suit? I heard that they built a new model. Assigned to Kycilia's force. It doesn't have any legs. Indeed. A new model? Is that the answer? It's amazing. That's how Newtypes fight. How can a cannon be so fast? It's coming in! The Gundam! It's too fast! Erik! Christo! That kind of person... ...exists? There is no doubt. They're asking us to surrender. Is it true that Admiral Gihren died in battle ?! Where is Admiral Kycilia's Gwazine? How should I know?! Is that Lt. Commander Erik? - All battered. -We need to tell him. No, we better not. Why? How do you want him to react if we say all is lost? He's going to return in battle if we resupply him! The battle looks like it died down... What happened? Eh? What happened? I see less and less explosions! Don't tell him. But... We can't let him die in vain. Hey! What's going on? -Remember! Minovsky particle density is very high. so we're having trouble with communications. Always happening. I wonder if Operation Wrath of Varuna has been accomplished? We're not doing it out of hate for Earth. Take my word for it.",
